  _packageCreatureName: Anifungus
  _packageCreatureDescription: "Anifungus\u2019 are small Package Creatures which
    are considered to be dangerous pests.They hide in places close to where people
    and animals reside for easy prey."
  _packageCreaturePersonality: "Anifungus\u2019 are generally manipulative as a result
    of their natural ability. Whenever they have the option to use someone for their
    needs, they will."
  _packageCreatureWeight: 0.75
  _packageCreatureLength: 7.5
  _packageCreatureAbilityName: Manipulation
  _packageCreatureAbilityDescription: Releasing spores from the ball on top of its
    body, Anifungus can control the body of any living being that inhales the spores.
